  "question": {
    "text": "There are <math><mn>7</mn></math> distinguishable rings. The number of possible five-rings arrangements on the four fingers (except the thumb) of one hand (the order of the rings on each finger is to be counted and it is not required that each finger has a ring) is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
